===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈsfɛɹ.ɪ.kɒn/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈsfɪɹ.ə.kɑn/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{geometry}} A [[solid]] constructed by slicing a 90-degree [[bicone]] through a [[plane]] containing both [[apex|apices]], rotating one half by 90 degrees, and [[reconnect]]ing them. The sphericon has a single continuous [[face]], and two edges.

